The initial module now passes all local gates: 0/200,000 valid structure-aware guesses, six heuristic attacks at 0/8, an exact demo count of one witness, and the reference scan solves 8/8 at about 3.32 million modular operations versus 68 for the compact route. I’m moving to the script-owned oracle ladder; its result may force the named difficulty presets upward.
