The hard rung has also produced one verified solution; a second vendor call is still running. If the full ladder remains solvable, I’ll treat that as a real family failure and redesign the compact encoding once—without hand-tuning individual seeds—before deciding whether the paper should be rejected.
diff --git a/gen_1706_09487.py b/gen_1706_09487.py
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..d02ff7bb147cdd5aab7bcd5e06da22b5c6e93098
