+| G9(c) | pass | 61 characters, about 16 tokens, 7 atoms, 73 intended operations |
+
+## Oracle loop
+
+These are the script-owned bare results before the ladder was renamed. A rung is defeated if any attempt succeeds; all three final shipping attempts failed with a parseable but non-highly-connected vertex set.
