codex
The final review found one place to strengthen G8: the test covered affine relabelings but its fourth case merely reordered the witness. I replaced that with a genuinely non-affine automorphism swapping the marked seed with a twin inside its clique, so the 80 checks now cover both coordinate changes and intrinsic graph symmetries.
